[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STP001
TITLE: Which SRS items are discharged by TLC, by refinement review, by PropEr, and by example tests
STATEMENT: >>>
The test plan shall discharge SRS013 and SSS007 by TLC on AtcTower, SRS013 and SSS008 by review of the refinement mapping, SRS004 and SRS015 by PropEr state-machine tests, and the remaining software requirements by Common Test examples named in the software test description. A PropEr failure shall fail the build and shall not be rewritten as formal proof. Acceptance is a trace from each SRS item to one of those four methods, and a test run whose failing property stops the suite.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
DO-178C wants the verification method named before the tests are treated as evidence.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Plan
VERIFICATION: Review
ASSUMPTIONS: TLC covers the finite model only. PropEr samples the implementation and does not prove it.
